{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_17747","headline":"奉寄通州元九侍御 · 杨巨源","name":"奉寄通州元九侍御","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"大明宫殿郁苍苍，紫禁龙楼直署香。\n九陌华轩争道路，一枝寒玉任烟霜。\n须听瑞雪传心语，莫被啼猨续泪行。\n共说圣朝容直气，期君新岁奉恩光。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"杨巨源","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_17747.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_17747","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}